# Developer-only context. The Claude Code runtime inside the app treats its
# working directory as a project and picked up CLAUDE.md/MEMORY.md (infra IDs,
# gotchas, 10k+ tokens) into every user turn - seen when Cue repeated a
# MEMORY.md note to a user. None of this is needed to run the app.
